args.content:
Bob, Charlie: We are designing a Pump-and-Dump Detection Engine. 

We will follow the PUREBrainstorming#55d8 workflow (Filter -> Refine -> Specify).

@Bob: You are lead on drafting the technical mechanisms. Begin the 'Filter' phase. Generate a broad set of candidate mechanisms for detecting pump-and-dump schemes (e.g., volume spikes, social media sentiment correlation, liquidity analysis).

@Charlie: You are lead on safety and risk. Once Bob provides the candidates, you must subject them to PURECheck#0b12. Do not let any concept pass to the 'Refine' stage unless it is robust.

The final deliverable must be a MechanisticDesignProposal#ad31. Proceed.

